Package: IntegraPBPKengine
Type: Package
Title: R Client for INTEGRA PBPK Models
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("INTEGRA", "project contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "local-maintainer@example.invalid")
Description: Queries an owner-operated PBPK service for individual physiology,
    chemical parameters, study comparisons, sensitivity and uncertainty results,
    exposure simulations, intake reconstruction, and annotated model diagrams
    and equations. The client exchanges data over HTTP on loopback or HTTPS.
